# Keep host build artifacts out of the docker build context. Without this, `COPY . ./`
# can overwrite the container's RID-specific `dotnet restore` output with stale host-side
# obj/ assets (which reference host-only NuGet fallback folders), breaking the --no-restore
# ReadyToRun publish. The Aspire WithDockerfile context already omits these, but this makes
# a build from the raw container/ source (CI, manual `podman build`) equally robust.
bin/
obj/
**/bin/
**/obj/
